{"title":"Dune Outrider","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 17 Raider that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/dune-whetstone\">Dune Whetstone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>277</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>307</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>51</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>277</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Outrider%20Camp\">Outrider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>307</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Outrider%20Camp\">Outrider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>19</b></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>51</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Outrider%20Camp\">Outrider Camp</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-outrider\" data-map-level=\"19\">Show level 19 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/00df2ba2db841f203145.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/35f5d92a8be10abecd0e.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Snakeskin armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/cdfab9ec86790fb6425d.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 10 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 10 looted corpses, 249 recorded drops, 7,317 total, 10–131 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/10</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-medium\" title=\"Stamina Potion Medium - in 30% of 10 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/df992b2657b50a24d683.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">30% · 3/10</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 20% of 10 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 10 total, 3–7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20% · 2/10</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 20% of 10 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 6 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20% · 2/10</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scroll-fire-blast\" title=\"Scroll Fire Blast - in 10% of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Fire Blast</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">10% · 1/10</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-longsword\" title=\"Silver Longsword - in 10% of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/36c081655f0175a8eac5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">10% · 1/10</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"raider-war-token\" title=\"Raider War Token - in 10% of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/bf443a9a14465ad3df84.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Raider War Token</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">10% · 1/10</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 10% of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">10% · 1/10</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-779.8px,-1859.0px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/2/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/2/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/3/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/3/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1792px\"><i style=\"left:760.9px;top:1861.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:768.0px;top:1820.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:822.2px;top:1895.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:758.2px;top:1872.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:732.7px;top:1844.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:793.4px;top:1830.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:823.4px;top:1887.7px\"></i></div><figcaption>Outrider Camp</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Outrider%20Camp\">Outrider Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-outrider\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/dust-rider-talin\"><img src=\"data/img/cdfab9ec86790fb6425d.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Dust-Rider Talin</b><span>Lv 19</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Raider: <a href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\">Dune Raider</a> <span class=\"muted\">(23)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder\">Dune Marauder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(29)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-warlord\">Dune Warlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">Dune Skirmisher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-blade\">Dune Blade</a> <span class=\"muted\">(41)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">Dune Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord\">Dune Sandlord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/raider-high-chief\">Raider High Chief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/00df2ba2db841f203145.webp\" alt=\"Dune Outrider\"></div><h3>Dune Outrider</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>19</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 17)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Raider</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>61</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>15</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>950</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>11 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}